The MIT license above covers the source code, scripts, launch and configuration
files of this package. It does not cover the contents of data/, which are
governed by the terms of their respective sources:

  data/miluv/  CSV extracted from the MILUV dataset (Shalaby et al., IJRR 2026),
               redistributed here under the terms of the upstream release.
  data/ntu/    CSV extracted from the NTU VIRAL dataset (Nguyen et al., IJRR
               2022), redistributed here under the terms of the upstream
               release.
  data/iului/  Collected by the authors and released with this package under the
               MIT terms above.

Cite the original dataset papers (see the README) if you use data/miluv or
data/ntu.
